<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS SELL 29.29 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS THUR.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS SELL 29.29 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS THUR.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 29.29 million rands worth of South African bonds on Thursday after buying 181.41 million on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
